<para>
  <classname>AllMeshTimes</classname>, when used as an argument to
  <xref linkend="MenuItem-OOF.Graphics_n.File.Animate"/>. It instructs
  the <link linkend="Chapter-Graphics">Graphics</link> window to
  construct an animation using all of the <link
  linkend="Section-Concepts-Mesh-Time">cached times</link> in any
  &mesh; that is being displayed in the window.
